# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
# Libraries should not include pubspec.lock, per https://dart.dev/guides/libraries/private-files#pubspeclock.
/pubspec.lock
**/doc/api/
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/

# Retired 1.x plugin scaffolding at the package root. Since 2.0 this is a pure
# Dart package with no native code of its own: there is no `flutter: plugin:`
# block in pubspec.yaml, and webview_flutter supplies the platform side. Builds
# still regenerate these paths locally with machine-specific files such as
# android/local.properties, so keep them out of git. `.pubignore` already keeps
# them out of the published archive.
/android/
/ios/
